  offline.

Local changes:
1. Non-ASCII punctuation (em dash, en dash, <=, ellipsis) rendered to ASCII to
   match this template's strict-ASCII convention. Meaning unchanged.
2. Removed the `--skill-version <hash>` pin from the example `search` command so
   it always runs `npx -y modern-web-guidance@latest`. The pin is a freshness
   handshake: once upstream bumps the skill it makes every call print an
   'out-of-date' warning and exit non-zero, which reads as a tool failure. Using
   @latest keeps calls clean and current.

